1609.01006.Method:
A schematic view of our DL framework is given in Fig.~\ref{fig:overview}. This framework is a combination of two key components: an FCN (called $k$U-Net) and an RNN (called BDC-LSTM), to exploit intra-slice and inter-slice contexts, respectively. Section~\ref{sec:kunet} presents the $k$U-Net, and Section~\ref{sec:rnn} introduces the derivation of the BDC-LSTM. We then show how to combine these two components in the framework to conduct 3D segmentation. Finally, we discuss the training strategy.  %either end-to-end or in a decoupled manner

